{"id":"vod_bf_36102","vodId":"36102","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我的妹妹哪有这么可爱","name_cn":"我的妹妹哪有这么可爱","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/91e25c97f14959eef7356243b0726c44.jpg"},"summary":"家住千叶县的17岁普通高中生高坂京介（中村悠一 配音）有一个14岁的妹妹高坂桐乃（竹达彩奈 配音），可是，很长一段时间以来，这个外表可爱的妹妹和自己的关系并不密切，有时甚至可以用冷淡来形容。妹妹的身上究竟发生了怎样的事情呢？终于有一天，一个关于桐乃的秘密被京介发现了。　　可爱 的妹妹居然是宅系的兄控？！虽然桐乃百般否认，但事实不容狡辩。随后，原本只在妹妹身边出没的千金大小姐槙岛沙织（生天目仁美 配音）和毒舌少女五更琉璃（花泽香菜 配音）也渐渐的围绕到了京介的身边来，她们都和妹妹一样，是秋叶原系的御宅族。因为是兄控而觉得分外苦闷的桐乃，究竟会和妹控的哥哥京介发展出一段怎样妙趣横生的关系呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:48:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":32,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"SP01","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP02","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP03","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP03/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP04","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP05","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP06","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP07","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP08","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP08/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP09","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP10","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP11","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP12","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodemeimeinayouzhemekeai/SP12/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP13","url":"